Bar, CategoryFilter, PropertyGrid, PropertyCard, FavoriteButton, FiltersPanel, Pagination\n3. **Property Detail Page (`/properties/:id`)** - Tests for ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard\n4. **My Trips Page (`/trips`)** - Tests for TripsTabs, TripCard, CancelBookingDialog\n5. **Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)** - Tests for StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, AddListingForm\n\nTotal: Extensive test specifications covering authentication, search/filtering, bookings, reviews, and host management.\n\n### 3. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`\n\n**File:** `auth.spec.ts` (214 lines)\n- Tests AuthToggle component (4 tests)\n- Tests LoginForm component (5 tests)\n- Tests RegisterForm component (6 tests)\n- Covers: mode toggling, validation, error handling, repeated use functionality\n\n### 4. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- Test directory: './tests'\n- Timeout: 60 seconds\n- Expect timeout: 10 seconds\n- Parallel: false (single worker)\n- Reporter: Replay reporter + JSON + HTML\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8888\n- Web Server: Netlify dev on port 8888\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n```\n\n### 5. COMPONENTS RELATED TO SEARCH BAR AND CATEGORY FILTER\n\n#### SearchBar Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx` (96 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Location text input (placeholder: \"Where are you going?\")\n- Check-in date picker (with min date validation)\n- Check-out date picker (must be after check-in)\n- Guest count selector (enforces min of 1)\n- Search/submit button with magnifying glass icon\n- Props: `onSearch`, `initialCity`, `initialCheckIn`, `initialCheckOut`, `initialGuests`\n- Prevents selecting checkout date <= checkin date\n\n#### CategoryFilter Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CategoryFilter.tsx` (49 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- 8 property type chips: \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Cabin\", \"Villa\", \"Condo\", \"Loft\", \"Cottage\", \"Townhouse\"\n- Horizontally scrollable\n- Toggle behavior: click to select, click again to deselect\n- Props: `selectedType`, `onSelectType`\n- Visual feedback: Selected chips have filled background (text/bg colors), unselected have outline\n\n#### FiltersPanel Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx` (255 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Toggle button to open/close panel\n- Price range inputs (min/max)\n- Room filters: Bedrooms, Beds, Bathrooms (dropdown selectors 0-8+)\n- Amenity checkboxes grouped by category\n- Apply and Clear buttons\n- Props: minPrice, maxPrice, minBedrooms, minBeds, minBathrooms, selectedAmenityIds, onApplyFilters, onReset\n\n#### PropertyCard Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx` (65 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Property image (with hover scale animation)\n- Property type badge (top-left)\n- Property title\n- Location (city, country)\n- Price per night\n- Star rating and review count (or \"New\" if no reviews)\n- FavoriteButton component integrated\n- Clickable to navigate to property detail page\n\n#### PropertyGrid Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx` (39 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Responsive grid: 1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 3-4 col desktop\n- Loading state with spinner\n- Empty state with message\n- Displays PropertyCard components\n\n#### Pagination Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx` (73 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Previous/Next buttons (disabled appropriately)\n- Page numbers with ellipsis for large page counts\n- Current page highlighting\n- Only shows when totalPages > 1\n- Props: currentPage, totalPages, onPageChange\n\n### 6. SEED DATA AND DATABASE SCHEMA\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/schema.ts`\n\n**Database Tables:**\n\n1. **users** - UUID PK, email (unique), name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host boolean, created_at\n2. **properties** - UUID PK, host_id (FK users), title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude, check_in_time, check_out_time, is_active, created_at, updated_at\n3. **property_images** - UUID PK, property_id (FK properties), url, caption, display_order\n4. **amenities** - UUID PK, name (unique), icon, category\n5. **property_amenities** - property_id + amenity_id (composite PK)\n6. **bookings** - UUID PK, property_id (FK), guest_id (FK users), check_in (date), check_out (date), num_guests, total_price, status (pending/confirmed/completed/cancelled), special_requests, created_at\n7. **reviews** - UUID PK, booking_id (unique FK), property_id (FK), guest_id (FK), rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value (all 1-5 checks), comment, created_at\n8. **favorites** - user_id + property_id (composite PK)\n\n**Indices:** 10 indexes for host_id, city, property_type, is_active, etc.\n\n### 7. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (API ENDPOINTS)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**properties.ts** (243 lines) - Key search function:\n- `GET /api/properties` - List properties with filters:\n  - Query params: `city`, `check_in`, `check_out`, `guests`, `property_type`, `min_price`, `max_price`, `min_bedrooms`, `min_beds`, `min_bathrooms`, `amenities`, `page`, `limit`\n  - Returns: properties array, total count, page info, totalPages\n  - Filtering logic: LIKE for city, >= for numeric filters, NOT EXISTS for date conflicts\n  - Amenity filtering: AND logic (all selected amenities must be present)\n  - Supports pagination with limit (default 12)\n- `GET /api/properties/:id` - Fetch single property with:\n  - Property details with host info (name, avatar, bio, created_at)\n  - Host listing count\n  - Property images (ordered by display_order)\n  - Amenities (ordered by category, name)\n  - Reviews with guest info (name, avatar)\n- `POST /api/properties` - Create new property (host_id, title, description, property_type, price, etc.)\n- `PUT /api/properties/:id` - Update property (is_active, title, description, price, cleaning_fee)\n- `DELETE /api/properties/:id` - Soft delete (sets is_active = false)\n\n**Other functions (12 files total):**\n- `auth.ts` - User authentication\n- `users.ts` - User profile management\n- `bookings.ts` - Booking management\n- `reviews.ts` - Review creation\n- `favorites.ts` - Favorite management\n- `amenities.ts` - Amenity lookup\n- `property-images.ts` - Image management\n- `host-listings.ts` - Host's listings\n- `host-bookings.ts` - Host's bookings\n- `host-stats.ts` - Host statistics\n- `db.ts` - Database connection\n\n### 8. HOME PAGE IMPLEMENTATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx` (102 lines)\n\n- Uses Redux for state management\n- Dispatches `fetchProperties` on filter changes\n- Fetches favorites if user is logged in\n- Manages search, category, and filter panel interactions\n- Props flow: filters → SearchBar, CategoryFilter, FiltersPanel → PropertyGrid\n- Pagination support with page state management\n\n### 9. REDUX PROPERTIES SLICE\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts` (187 lines)\n\n- **SearchFilters interface:** city, checkIn, checkOut, guests, propertyType, minPrice, maxPrice, minBedrooms, minBeds, minBathrooms, amenityIds, page\n- **Property interface:** Full property details + optional host info, images, amenities, reviews\n- **fetchProperties thunk:** Async fetch with URL params, default limit 12\n- **Actions:** setFilters, resetFilters, setPage\n- Initial state: Empty array, filters all default values\n\n### KEY INSIGHTS FOR TESTING\n\n1. **Search Implementation:** Combines text matching (LIKE for city) with multiple filter criteria using AND logic\n2. **Date Filtering:** Prevents booking conflicts by checking for overlapping bookings\n3. **Amenity Filtering:** Uses array-based AND logic (all selected amenities required)\n4. **Pagination:** Default 12 items per page, supports custom limits\n5. **Component Architecture:** Controlled components using Redux state\n6. **Test Data:** auth.spec.ts uses real users (emma@example.com, sarah@example.com) with seed data\n7. **API Base URL:** http://localhost:8888 via Netlify dev\n8. **Responsive Grid:** 1→2→3-4 columns based on viewport\n\nAll file paths are absolute and ready for reference in test implementation."}],"totalDurationMs":45558,"totalTokens":74542,"totalToolUseCount":30,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5504,"cache_read_input_tokens":66250,"output_tokens":2783,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5504},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
